Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.91,0:00:04.97,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄契阔！福蝶噗鸡！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.80,0:00:07.90,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,小公主好帅啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.47,0:00:09.42,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,爱！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.65,0:00:12.74,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,接着一起来飞翼冲击吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.01,0:00:14.10,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,爱
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.27,0:00:15.40,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,预备
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.60,0:00:20.18,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄气阔！飞翼冲击！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.37,0:00:21.78,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.34,0:00:27.88,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗... 国王和王妃还没有醒...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:32.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 说好听点是维持现状...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.75,0:00:35.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人民和军队都没有放弃希望
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.52,0:00:40.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是 不安的情绪一直在蔓延...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.07,0:00:44.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是闪亮药水没错吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.45,0:00:49.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还需要多少 才能够制作解除沉睡诅咒的药？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.64,0:00:54.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure们正在竭尽全力收集闪亮能量
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.65,0:00:56.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在的量还远不足够
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.36,0:00:59.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.60,0:01:00.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.60,0:01:02.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂！我们正在开会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.70,0:01:04.84,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,莉虹莓队员！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.24,0:01:08.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴！有件事情我要告诉你...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.47,0:01:10.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你别急！我会跟她讲的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.00,0:01:14.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是关于队长... 关于现在下落不明的飒拉拉队长的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.80,0:01:16.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得到了新的情报！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.16,0:02:57.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}虚蜢达 最后的秘策！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.44,0:03:06.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.72,0:03:12.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个人...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.24,0:03:18.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你说的是真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.50,0:03:19.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.61,0:03:24.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最近有很多人向我们报告 都说"见到了队长"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.40,0:03:28.67,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下 是只有目击情报吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.59,0:03:31.74,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,又不是妖怪或者幽灵
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.13,0:03:34.54,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,目击到之后都是怎么样的情况？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.75,0:03:40.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关于这个... 目击者都说 队长就像烟一样消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.53,0:03:44.45,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是真的 还是假的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.91,0:03:47.88,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,光是在这里谈 也查不出头绪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.30,0:03:53.04,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,请继续搜索 如果有什么新的消息 一定要告诉我们
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.28,0:03:57.79,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不管是多小的线索... 我们等你 莉虹莓队员
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.19,0:03:59.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.44,0:04:02.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.68,0:04:05.81,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你在做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.00,0:04:08.26,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,呜哇... 哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.78,0:04:12.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.92,0:04:15.01,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,这是...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.44,0:04:16.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.33,0:04:20.84,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是飒拉拉队长留给我的信
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.34,0:04:23.30,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,“别停下脚步 英雄少女"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.95,0:04:27.14,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我想誊写到手账上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.49,0:04:30.60,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗... 抱歉打扰到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.82,0:04:32.24,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.14,0:04:35.15,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,爱
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.55,0:04:36.80,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么说呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.48,0:04:40.33,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不管大事小事都会记到手账上的小晴
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.50,0:04:44.27,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,居然一直没把队长的嘱咐记下来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.42,0:04:45.46,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,有点出乎意料啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.70,0:04:47.93,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不是大事小事都会记的...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.07,0:04:50.34,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？可是上一次...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.79,0:04:53.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,每周二是肉打半价的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.79,0:04:53.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}牛肉祭 限期2周
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.14,0:04:57.08,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那是... 你就当没有过！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.63,0:05:02.01,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,写在这本手账上 就代表着我绝对会履行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.57,0:05:04.30,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我是秉持这个信念才会记手账的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.66,0:05:07.71,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,"别停下脚步 英雄少女"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.44,0:05:11.49,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我之前都没有能够履行的自信...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.00,0:05:17.67,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,飒拉拉队长要是有个三长两短 我还能继续前进吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.45,0:05:20.44,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我还能继续做一个英雄吗...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.19,0:05:22.44,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.96,0:05:25.22,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才谢谢你了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.41,0:05:26.48,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.97,0:05:29.59,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,在前进的脚步放缓速度的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.07,0:05:33.39,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是真白同学在我身边 推动了我前进...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.03,0:05:38.55,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,今天我有了记下来的勇气
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.01,0:05:42.93,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,把飒拉拉队长的话语 记在这本宝贵的手账上
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.36,0:05:48.82,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,"别停下脚步 英雄少女"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.01,0:05:50.13,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.54,0:05:52.43,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.14,0:05:55.25,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对要成为英雄！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.42,0:05:57.09,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,爱！英雄！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.27,0:05:58.42,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,要当英雄！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.61,0:06:00.03,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.62,0:06:02.97,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定... 能成英雄的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.84,0:06:08.25,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,饺子... 这是诞生在这个世界的究极美食！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.55,0:06:09.66,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,味道是很棒啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.83,0:06:14.08,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,但是最妙的 还得是大家围着大盘子边吃边闹
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.38,0:06:16.49,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,止不住的幸福呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.82,0:06:19.53,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,今天也会做小空喜欢的芝士饺子哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.74,0:06:22.30,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,芝士 稀饭稀饭
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.72,0:06:26.90,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,（心跳声）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.09,0:06:42.25,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.28,0:06:44.51,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,飒拉拉队长！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.04,0:06:46.01,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.73,0:07:44.17,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,飒拉拉队长！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.24,0:07:48.80,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.97,0:08:07.24,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,小戏法啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.35,0:08:12.40,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,是用一点点暗塌谷能量 就能做出来的幻影
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.74,0:08:16.53,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,要是真的话 你现在已经成两瓣了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.98,0:08:21.25,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么？你为什么要耍这种把戏戏弄人！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.43,0:08:22.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么意思吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.23,0:08:26.81,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,有意思啊 不要太有意思哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.10,0:08:28.53,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你跟我有什么仇...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.69,0:08:31.06,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,有啊！仇大着呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.31,0:08:33.62,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不许动！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.34,0:08:39.07,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你胆敢再靠近小空一丝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.85,0:08:41.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我绝对饶不了你！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.88,0:09:03.20,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,虚...虚蜢蜢...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.11,0:09:13.20,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我恨你... 憎恨到胸口都快要裂开了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.23,0:09:16.55,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,让我这样强大而不失温柔的人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.68,0:09:20.67,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,催生出了这种阴暗的憎恨 这个责任...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.89,0:09:22.71,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你可得好好负责啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.12,0:09:24.32,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你太自私了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.62,0:09:25.66,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哼哼哼...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.74,0:09:34.46,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,且看我英雄亮相！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.64,0:09:49.36,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,且看我英雄亮相！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.71,0:09:56.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,天空幻镜！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.71,0:09:56.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Sky Mirage！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.92,0:09:59.35,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,天籁接通！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.92,0:09:59.35,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Tone Connect！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.59,0:10:06.24,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,海阔天空变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.94,0:10:08.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,天空！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.94,0:10:08.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.25,0:10:18.55,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,闪耀起步！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.25,0:10:18.55,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}HOP
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.33,0:10:26.67,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,爽朗飞奔！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.33,0:10:26.67,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}STEP
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.80,0:10:34.49,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,畅快跃起！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.80,0:10:34.49,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}JUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.20,0:10:57.38,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,广阔无限的蓝天！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.79,0:11:00.07,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.79,0:11:00.07,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}天空愈卫！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.50,0:11:07.34,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.94,0:11:15.18,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.46,0:11:19.67,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,鬼鬼祟祟地躲在乱暴兽的背后！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.05,0:11:23.45,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,就能够满足你那无谓的自尊吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.82,0:11:26.08,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈... 乱暴兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.02,0:11:30.34,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.40,0:11:39.48,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.86,0:11:43.64,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,利落的剑法...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.20,0:11:46.78,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,被砍到的话 可不是吃一下痛那么简单
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.44,0:11:48.31,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,拉拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.61,0:11:53.94,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,可是！只要砍不到 也算不了什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.30,0:11:55.89,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.15,0:11:57.12,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嘁...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.75,0:11:59.14,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.04,0:12:01.26,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.84,0:12:05.04,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,只要冲上去打近身！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.41,0:12:06.40,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,拉拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.06,0:12:09.53,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,拳头可比挥剑要来的快！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.89,0:12:12.24,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.04,0:12:16.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,虚蜢达！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.41,0:12:21.43,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哼... 压轴戏现在才开始呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.39,0:12:25.55,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.15,0:12:39.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,这是...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.55,0:12:41.34,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哼哼...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.63,0:12:43.03,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,披风？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.40,0:13:05.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,难道是...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.96,0:13:08.72,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,没错！就是你想的那样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.54,0:13:22.43,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,就是你最亲爱的飒拉拉队长
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.61,0:13:25.70,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我向她注入的暗塌谷能量
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.38,0:13:30.18,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你做了很过分的事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.60,0:13:35.95,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你对乱暴兽的攻击 都会反馈到队长的身体上呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.14,0:13:38.08,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.43,0:13:43.42,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴兽...不 飒拉拉兽 给我上！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.74,0:13:45.64,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.45,0:13:50.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你长大了啊 小晴
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.17,0:13:53.44,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.37,0:13:59.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能与你像现在这样重逢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.72,0:14:02.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说不定也是受到这宝石的指引
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.00,0:14:10.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.69,0:14:13.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该英雄亮相了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.71,0:14:17.95,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.18,0:14:26.65,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱... 暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.36,0:14:31.03,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.32,0:14:32.97,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.41,0:14:34.39,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,拉拉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.29,0:14:36.61,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.53,0:14:38.55,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.60,0:14:42.96,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.41,0:14:44.34,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.63,0:14:45.66,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我来！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.83,0:14:48.09,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.68,0:14:51.09,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.50,0:14:53.01,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,漂亮 Wing！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.67,0:15:02.56,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,双色合一！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.83,0:15:04.10,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,黄色！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.83,0:15:04.10,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Yellow！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.51,0:15:06.69,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝色！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.51,0:15:06.69,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Blue！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.42,0:15:13.18,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,治愈的力量 飞扬起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.90,0:15:17.93,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.99,0:15:21.21,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.97,0:15:23.73,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.87,0:15:24.78,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.95,0:15:25.97,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.44,0:15:31.48,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.54,0:15:35.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,快停下！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.58,0:15:38.85,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不要打！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.03,0:15:40.25,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.87,0:15:42.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是队长！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.31,0:15:45.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,它是... 飒拉拉队长！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.77,0:15:48.03,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.67,0:15:49.52,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.70,0:15:52.09,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.28,0:15:54.55,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.71,0:16:00.54,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,飒拉拉队长被暗塌谷能量 变成乱暴兽了...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.30,0:16:05.53,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会... 怎么可能...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.52,0:16:07.75,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.39,0:16:18.26,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,救救我... 真白同学...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.18,0:16:32.04,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,不能攻击飒拉拉队长... 该怎么办...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.45,0:16:33.42,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,Wing！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.28,0:16:36.40,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我们这还有杀手锏！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.96,0:16:40.08,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,是暗塌谷能量在作祟吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.65,0:16:45.55,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,那就好！只要净化干净就行了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.69,0:16:50.40,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊... 我们还有绚烂彩虹！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.89,0:16:53.12,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.06,0:17:07.57,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.72,0:17:08.93,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.32,0:17:10.50,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.64,0:17:11.75,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.19,0:17:13.24,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,拉... 拉拉...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.49,0:17:15.32,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,精... 精彩？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.49,0:17:15.32,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Won... Wonderful？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.72,0:17:17.34,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱... 暴...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.71,0:17:17.15,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an3}是啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.49,0:17:19.08,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 该出招了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.26,0:17:20.61,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,OK！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.01,0:17:24.05,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,全色合一！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.34,0:17:25.68,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,融合调色盘！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.34,0:17:25.68,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Mix Palette！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.12,0:17:26.96,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,红色！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.12,0:17:26.96,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Red！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.82,0:17:29.98,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,黄色！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.82,0:17:29.98,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Yellow！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.42,0:17:32.61,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝色！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.42,0:17:32.61,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Blue！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.12,0:17:35.39,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,白色！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.12,0:17:35.39,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}White！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.97,0:17:42.85,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,搅拌搅拌
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.02,0:17:44.53,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,色彩填充！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.02,0:17:44.53,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Colour Charge！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.93,0:17:47.21,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哼... 哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.95,0:17:52.55,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么古怪... 究竟是哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.47,0:18:03.42,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.82,0:18:04.80,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.02,0:18:09.98,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嘁 被看出来的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.23,0:18:11.79,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.13,0:18:15.16,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这回事 哼哼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.96,0:18:21.26,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,虚... 虚蜢蜢...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.28,0:18:32.78,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嘁...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.89,0:18:37.40,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！Cure Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.56,0:18:41.31,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,饶不了你 今天的屈辱我绝对要...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.59,0:18:42.94,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.40,0:18:50.27,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,放任不管的话 你就完了 不过...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.76,0:18:53.11,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 暗塌谷能量！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.54,0:18:55.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.96,0:18:59.09,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暗塌谷能量能止住你的伤口
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.38,0:19:03.43,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,代替你流失的血液 成为你的生命力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.62,0:19:05.25,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.60,0:19:07.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.90,0:19:13.28,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.97,0:19:19.63,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,飒拉拉队长是靠着暗塌谷能量才活着的...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.92,0:19:24.76,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,要是净化掉的话 会发生什么事呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.62,0:19:36.03,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,对！不管是你们引以自豪的绚烂彩虹 还是升流耀光
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.24,0:19:40.83,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,都会是终结队长的夺命招数啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.01,0:19:45.50,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈哈哈哈... 哈哈哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.70,0:19:47.64,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱... 暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.88,0:19:53.44,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,原本的计划 是让你们干掉队长
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.74,0:19:57.73,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,这样你们就会陷入无底的绝望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.90,0:20:00.97,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,既然被看穿了 好吧 让你们自己选择
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.13,0:20:08.34,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,是打倒队长 还是被队长打倒
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.66,0:20:12.73,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.47,0:20:15.39,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暴
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.74,0:20:19.00,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！偏偏在高潮的地方...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.29,0:20:24.14,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,向人类注入暗塌谷能量 本来就不稳定
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.76,0:20:26.09,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,虚蜢达！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.91,0:20:29.31,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.47,0:20:31.54,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嘁... 虚蜢蜢！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.96,0:20:37.19,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哼哼...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.40,0:20:40.87,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我会一次又一次地来找你们玩
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.34,0:20:45.28,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,直到你们的心碎成渣渣
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.77,0:20:48.38,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.13,0:20:55.32,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.48,0:20:59.24,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,一定有救回队长的办法的... 好不好？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.01,0:21:02.27,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你告诉我有什么方法...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.71,0:21:03.51,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.67,0:21:04.88,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 调色盘！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.12,0:21:08.25,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,使用融合调色盘 应该会起效果的！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.67,0:21:13.65,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,先净化暗塌谷能量 然后马上用治疗的功能
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.94,0:21:15.43,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,应该就能救到...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.58,0:21:16.74,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,要是不行呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.89,0:21:18.74,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,飒拉拉队长会怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.94,0:21:20.89,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？这... 这就...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.08,0:21:23.75,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,晴雯丽！只能相信这个方法 付诸行动了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.97,0:21:25.91,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄是永不言弃的...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.07,0:21:27.10,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,别说了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.79,0:21:30.25,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,什么英雄...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.61,0:21:31.73,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.48,0:21:37.51,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想... 再战斗了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.57,0:21:44.29,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,幻镜笔！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.22,0:23:48.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我没能成为英雄...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.87,0:23:51.15,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,不好了 上次的乱暴兽出现在城里了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.33,0:23:52.53,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,而且变得更强了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.69,0:23:53.72,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,究竟要怎么办...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.92,0:23:55.73,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.00,0:23:58.20,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我们去救飒拉拉队长！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.09,0:24:00.18,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.09,0:24:00.18,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海阔天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.37,0:24:03.13,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,粉碎的梦想与复苏的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.28,0:01:21.49,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（冲上蓝天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.49,0:01:27.08,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 超越云巅
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.29,0:01:32.63,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飞吧！向着海阔天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.63,0:01:40.34,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空万里 美丽蓝天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.54,0:01:45.50,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨后初霁天空棱镜折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.71,0:01:49.72,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝天的景色预告着有好事发生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.72,0:01:51.23,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（蓝天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.23,0:01:55.53,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要确认一下 便伸直了双手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.11,0:02:00.11,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名为希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.20,0:02:02.07,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速紧握！紧紧握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.20,0:02:06.66,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,战胜绝望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.04,0:02:10.61,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.61,0:02:14.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦干眼泪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.65,0:02:14.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已经做好准备了吗）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.00,0:02:15.99,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飞跃而起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.40,0:02:15.99,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(让我们张开勇气之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.32,0:02:21.76,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 朝气蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.97,0:02:26.43,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把烦躁化为光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.66,0:02:31.73,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未来的图景 充满着可能
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.90,0:02:36.42,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,与在同一片蓝天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.86,0:02:39.28,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起唤起通向明日的奇迹！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.40,0:02:47.28,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海阔天空！Precure
